{
	"about": "WO-1106 B67 — shaders WITHDRAWN from the shipped library (repo, ISO, releases) because their licence is NonCommercial (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 / 4.0, CC BY-NC 4.0). HighAsCG is used at paid shows; owner decision 17.11.26: \"Don't ship them\". Their template/shaders/<id>.html files were deleted from the repo; this record keeps who made each one and where it came from. Not hand-picked: every manifest row whose licence id contains -NC was withdrawn.",
	"rule": "A shader ships only when its licence allows commercial use and redistribution. src/shaderfx/shader-licence.js treats a config as non-commercial when its attribution names an -NC licence, its id (or its Shader Live parent) is listed here, or a FragCoord import recorded licenseKind nc. Such a config is held on that box only (data/shaders, never in the ISO): the store never exports it to template/shaders, never seeds it from a stale template, and lists it marked nonCommercial / local. A new one needs the operator's explicit allowNonCommercial (their own choice and responsibility, per machine).",
	"getIt": "An operator who wants one of these for non-paid work imports it on that machine from its source link (FragCoord / Shadertoy import with allowNonCommercial). Boxes that already had them keep their local data/shaders copy.",
	"withdrawnAt": "2026-11-17",
	"counts": {
		"CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0": 12,
		"CC-BY-NC-SA-3.0": 156,
		"CC-BY-NC-4.0": 1
